{"schema":1,"revision":94365681,"page":{"pageid":999061,"title":"本體","displayTitle":"本體","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173172\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-size:small}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:2em;margin-bottom:0.8em;margin-top:0.8em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small{display:none}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\"><span class=\"noviewer hatnote-notice-img\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%B6%88%E6%AD%A7%E4%B9%89\" title=\"Wikipedia:消歧義\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/40px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/60px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"220\" data-file-height=\"168\" /></a></span>關於本體的其他用法，請見「<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93_(%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%A6)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"本體 (哲學)\">本體 (哲學)</a></b>」和「<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93_(%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6)\" title=\"本體 (信息科學)\">本體 (資訊科學)</a></b>」。</div> \n<p><b>本體</b>（英語：<span lang=\"en\">Noumenon</span>，<span class=\"nowrap\"><small>發音： </small><span class=\"IPA nopopups\" lang=\"en-fonipa\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help:%E8%8B%B1%E8%AA%9E%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E9%9F%B3%E6%A8%99\" title=\"Help:英語國際音標\">/<span style=\"border-bottom:1px dotted\"><span title=\"/ˈ/：後面為主重音\">ˈ</span><span title=\"「nigh」的「n」音\">n</span><span title=\"/uː/：「goose」的「oo」音\">uː</span><span title=\"「my」的「m」音\">m</span><span title=\"/ɛ/：「dress」的「e」音\">ɛ</span><span title=\"/ˌ/：後面為次重音\">ˌ</span><span title=\"「nigh」的「n」音\">n</span><span title=\"/ɒ/：「body」的「o」音\">ɒ</span><span title=\"「nigh」的「n」音\">n</span></span>/</a></span></span>），哲學名詞，意指不必用<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98\" title=\"感官\">感官</a>去知識到的物體或事件。它與<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8F%BE%E8%B1%A1\" title=\"現象\">現象</a>是兩個相對的名詞，是<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BD%A2%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%B8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"形上學\">形上學</a>中重要的議題。研究本體的學問，稱為<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93%E8%AE%BA_(%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%A6)\" title=\"本體論 (哲學)\">本體論</a>。<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BA%B7%E5%BE%B7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"康德\">康德</a>稱本體為<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%A9%E8%87%AA%E4%BD%93_(%E5%BA%B7%E5%BE%B7)\" title=\"物自體 (康德)\">物自身</a></b>（德語：<span lang=\"de\">das Ding an sich</span> ，英語：<span lang=\"en\">thing-in-itself</span>，又譯為<b>物自體</b>）。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"字源\"><span id=\".E5.AD.97.E6.BA.90\"></span>字源</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%9C%AC%E9%AB%94&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：字源\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>本體（Noumenon）來自於<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B8%8C%E8%87%98%E8%AA%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"希臘語\">希臘語</a>：<span lang=\"el\">νοούμενoν</span>，它的複數形是<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B8%8C%E8%87%98%E8%AA%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"希臘語\">希臘語</a>：<span lang=\"el\">νοούμενα</span>，字面意思為「在思想中的某事物」、「思想所對應的對象」。它是<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B8%8C%E8%87%98%E8%AA%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"希臘語\">希臘語</a>：<span lang=\"el\">νοεῖν</span>（noein）的現在<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%86%E8%AF%8D\" title=\"分詞\">分詞</a>，原義是「我思、我想」。英語中的<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%99%BA%E6%80%A7\" title=\"智性\">智性</a>（<span title=\"英語文本\"><span lang=\"en\">nous</span></span>），也是來自於這個希臘文字根。\n</p><p>在<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9F%8F%E6%8B%89%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%BB%E7%BE%A9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"柏拉圖主義\">柏拉圖主義</a>中，本體的領域，在於<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%90%86%E5%9E%8B%E8%AB%96\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"理型論\">理型</a>的世界。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"外部連結\"><span id=\".E5.A4.96.E9.83.A8.E9.80.A3.E7.B5.90\"></span>外部連結</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%9C%AC%E9%AB%94&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：外部連結\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://archive.org/details/surdofmetaphysic00caru\"><i>The surd of metaphysics; an inquiry into the question: Are there things-in-themselves?</i> (1903) Paul Carus, 1852–1919 Retrieved May 18, 2012</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.science.uva.nl/~seop/entries/kant-metaphysics/\">Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy on Kant's metaphysics</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20131114211845/http://www.science.uva.nl/~seop/entries/kant-metaphysics/\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.hkbu.edu.hk/~ppp/ksp1/KSPglos.html\">Glossary of Kant's technical terms</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20091102223731/http://www.hkbu.edu.hk/~ppp/ksp1/KSPglos.html\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>） by Stephen Palmquist</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.chass.utoronto.ca/pcu/noesis/issue_v/noesis_v_2.html\">Article from undergraduate journal <i>Noesis</i></a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20100325102045/http://www.chass.utoronto.ca/pcu/noesis/issue_v/noesis_v_2.html\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100612165634/http://www-philosophy.ucdavis.edu/mattey/kant/APPEAR.HTM\">Lecture notes by G.J Mattey</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.hkbu.edu.hk/~ppp/ksp1\">Kant's System of Perspectives</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20120414204136/http://www.hkbu.edu.hk/~ppp/ksp1\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>） (Lanham: University Press of America, 1993) by Stephen Palmquist</li></ul>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173189\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist .mw-empty-li{display:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dt::after{content:\" :\"}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li::after{content:\" · \";font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .hlist-pipe dd::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist-pipe li::after{content:\" | \";font-weight:normal}.mw-pars